{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25831","headline":"新楼诗二十首 灵汜桥 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首 灵汜桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵汜桥边多感伤，分明湖派绕回塘。\n岸花前後闻幽鸟，湖月高低怨绿杨。\n能促岁阴惟白发，巧乘风马是春光。\n何须化鹤归华表，却数凋零念越乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}